Subject: [PATCH] Add GEX intensity gauge to the Score & regime tab

Scores today's net GEX against its own historical range (-100 = most negative in the window, +100 = most positive, positive and negative sides scaled separately). Self-contained SVG gauge, no new dependencies, selectable lookback window. Display only; not part of the direction score. Bumps CORE_VERSION to 2026-11-23.1.
